# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# THE MUTATION HARNESSES.  TRACK MUTWIRE, 2026-09-20.
#
# MEASURED: sixty-three sim/mutate_*.sh exist and NOT ONE of them was reachable
# from any row of this gate.  The three dispatch paths are a closed set --
# run_one runs $GHDL, run_graygate runs sim/gray_check.sh, run_seam runs
